{"seq":2,"slug":"composition-theory","title":"构图理论","stage":"DONE","category":"photography-video","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 构图理论 简介\n\n构图是将三维现实世界组织为二维画面的视觉语言。与技术参数不同，构图没有绝对的\"正确答案\"，但它有可被学习的规律与原则——这些规律源自人类视觉感知的生理机制与文化审美的心理积淀。掌握构图理论，意味着从\"碰运气式拍摄\"转变为有意识地控制观者视线、传达情感意图的创作者。\n\n构图的本质是**选择与排列**：在取景框内选择纳入什么、排除什么，以及被纳入的元素如何在画面中分布。这一看似简单的行为，实际上涉及视觉感知心理学、格式塔理论、色彩对比、空间透视等多个维度的综合决策。\n\n本手册从视觉的基本构成元素出发，逐步上升到构图原则、动态张力，最终落地到具体拍摄题材的构图特点。全书共分为四个章节：\n\n**第一章「视觉元素」** 解构画面的最小单位：点、线、面、形状与纹理。任何复杂的构图都可以还原为这些基本元素的组合。你将学习每种元素的视觉特性——如何引导视线、创造节奏、建立层次。\n\n**第二章「构图原则」** 系统讲解经过时间验证的经典构图法则：三分法、对称与不对称、引导线、框架构图、黄金比例等。更重要的是，你将理解每条法则背后的感知心理学依据，从而知道何时遵循、何时打破。\n\n**第三章「动态构图」** 超越静态的\"规则应用\"，探索画面中的视觉张力、运动感与空间层次。你将学习如何通过对角线、不稳定平衡、前中后景的经营来创造戏剧性与叙事感。\n\n**第四章「题材构图」** 将前三章的理论应用到具体的摄影题材：人像、风景、建筑、街拍各有其独特的构图考量。你将学习每个题材的视觉传统、常见陷阱与创新突破方向。\n\n构图能力的提升是一个从\"知道规则\"到\"内化直觉\"的渐进过程。建议在学习理论的同时大量观看经典摄影作品，尝试用本手册提供的分析框架去解构它们的构图逻辑。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"visual-elements","title":"视觉元素","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/visual-elements","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"point-line-plane","title":"点线面的视觉语法","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/visual-elements/point-line-plane"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shapes","title":"形状与视觉识别","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/visual-elements/shapes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"texture","title":"纹理与质感表现","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/visual-elements/texture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"composition-principles","title":"构图原则","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/composition-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rule-of-thirds-golden-ratio","title":"三分法与黄金比例","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/composition-principles/rule-of-thirds-golden-ratio"},{"seq":2,"slug":"symmetry-balance","title":"对称与视觉平衡","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/composition-principles/symmetry-balance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"leading-lines-framing","title":"引导线与框架构图","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/composition-principles/leading-lines-framing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-composition","title":"动态构图","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/dynamic-composition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"visual-tension","title":"视觉张力与构图势能","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/dynamic-composition/visual-tension"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sense-of-motion","title":"运动感与动态表现","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/dynamic-composition/sense-of-motion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spatial-layers","title":"空间层次与纵深构图","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/dynamic-composition/spatial-layers"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"genre-composition","title":"题材构图","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/genre-composition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"portrait-composition","title":"人像构图法则与实践","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/genre-composition/portrait-composition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"landscape-nature","title":"风景与自然构图","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/genre-composition/landscape-nature"},{"seq":3,"slug":"architecture-street","title":"建筑与街拍构图","url":"/h/photography-video/composition-theory/genre-composition/architecture-street"}]}]}